DrawDash Free-Stack Fork
========================

This project is a fork of https://github.com/SuveenE/drawdash
(MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025 Suveen Ellawela).

Upstream paper: Proactive Agentic Whiteboards: Enhancing Diagrammatic Learning
https://arxiv.org/abs/2512.01234

Modifications in this fork:
- Default IMAGE_PROVIDER=local-diagram (Pillow boxes, no API key)
- Optional svg-llm, pollinations, and paid gemini-image providers
- Local /demo mode without Supabase
- Soft-disable of Supabase background saves when env vars are unset
- Local faster-whisper for Agent Mode speech

The original MIT license text is preserved in LICENSE.
